{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18627","headline":"酬徐二中丞普宁郡内池馆即事见寄 · 柳宗元","name":"酬徐二中丞普宁郡内池馆即事见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵷鸿念旧行，虚馆对芳塘。\n落日明朱槛，繁花照羽觞。\n泉归沧海近，树入楚山长。\n荣贱俱爲累，相期在故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}